WEBVTT

00:05:58.238 --> 00:06:00.906
that frames this movement in ways
that make it difficult

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.175
to move our work forward,

00:06:03.199 --> 00:06:05.873
and right-wing pundits and other critics

00:06:05.897 --> 00:06:11.127
have these talking points
that shift the focus away from survivors.

00:06:11.978 --> 00:06:14.756
So suddenly, a movement
that was started to support

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:17.206
all survivors of sexual violence

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.587
is being talked about
like it's a vindictive plot against men.

00:06:21.211 --> 00:06:22.618
And I'm like, "Huh?"

00:06:22.992 --> 00:06:24.745
(Laughter)

00:06:25.741 --> 00:06:27.015
How did we get here?

00:06:29.984 --> 00:06:32.304
We have moved so far away